ncreases a couple of years ago, obviously, did disrupt what ended up being at margins, and we're kind of climbing through that and working with our OEMs through that as well still.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/watsco-inc-wso-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Cory Fulton","x":"But anything in terms of what you're seeing or potentially seeing from maybe a cost-cutting perspective?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/watsco-inc-wso-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Cory Fulton","x":"Anything impacting the business in terms of layoffs or furloughs or anything like that, that so far, maybe giving you an indication of something that might take place throughout the year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/watsco-inc-wso-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2020-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joshua Pokrzywinski","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/watsco-inc-wso-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2020-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brett Linzey","x":"And then maybe just shifting to price, what are you seeing from a pricing standpoint, any intra-quarter July price increases, given the strength of the market here?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/watsco-inc-wso-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2020-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joshua Pokrzywinski","x":"Does that, is that color you're thinking or is that something that would be revisited if tariffs were to go up?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/watsco-inc-wso-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brett Linzey","x":"I'll leave it there and pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/watsco-inc-wso-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David John Manthey","x":"But as always, hoping you can disaggregate the organic equipment growth, units versus price/mix there?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watsco-inc-wso-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry S. Logan","x":"So almost all the OEMs already announced pricing actions, price increases for 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watsco-inc-wso-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2020 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry S. Logan","x":"So 2020, you're right, an early spring reaction to all the knives that were falling helping with cost reduction and provoking cost reduction for good reasons.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watsco-inc-wso-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2021 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Pokrzywinski","x":"And what may be some of those high inventory levels that some of your competitors may have means for price realization, if folks find themselves with a little extra on their hands this year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/watsco-inc-wso-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2021 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Sprague","x":"And I wonder if, with all the price that OEMs are pushing through the channel, on the flip side, do you see any kind of tension and the ability of the consumer to digest some of these price increases that are coming through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/watsco-inc-wso-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2021 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry S. Logan","x":"Clearly, price increases as they flow through benefit some of the gross margin flow-through, if you will.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/watsco-inc-wso-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2021 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry S. Logan","x":"That doesn't mean necessarily raise price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/watsco-inc-wso-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2021 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2021-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tommy Moll","x":"If I could, I wanted to pivot to the customer side of the business for you, how receptive have they been of late to price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/watsco-inc-wso-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2021 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2021-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tommy Moll","x":"And I asked that because clearly there is input inflation on the OEM side, presumably in this environment, your customers are going to be pretty receptive to your passing that through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/watsco-inc-wso-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Johnston","x":"50% tariff start on copper.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/watsco-wso-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"A.J. Nahmad","x":"I mean, I think real it's all been said, but has gotta be the noisiest year in HVAC ever be between the tariffs and the weather and consumer confidence and the canister shortages and the home building changes and interest rates and trading homes isn't happening as frequently.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/watsco-wso-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2025-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Johnston","x":"I don't think on the equipment side, we're gonna see a lot of price increases going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/watsco-wso-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q2","e":"wso","d":"2025-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Albert Nahmad","x":"I think there is obviously an algebraic benefit to margin when OEMs raise prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/watsco-wso-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Nigel Coe","x":"Record lows in the trading of homes and building new homes, the tariffs creating, I would say, uncertainty for many homeowners of what their cost of living is going to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/watsco-wso-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Johnston","x":"So a price increase at that point is going to increase, let us say they go up, you know, pick a number.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/watsco-wso-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q3","e":"wso","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Albert Nahmad","x":"But when you look at the actual unit sales, you know, without the price increase, I think they are pretty much in line with what the market is showing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/watsco-wso-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2026-02-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Johnston","x":"Those were two markets that certainly had some influence with geopolitical issues and tariffs and the like.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/watsco-wso-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2026-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry Logan","x":"on the part of OEMs when they're talking about 2026 and price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/watsco-wso-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2026-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry Logan","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/watsco-wso-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2026-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Gomez","x":"I mean, we our business unit leaders did a good job rightsizing the business for the current market environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/watsco-wso-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2025 Q4","e":"wso","d":"2026-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Gomez","x":"Do you think there's more rightsizing that needs to take place, or you think you're in pretty good shape?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/watsco-wso-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2026 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Barry S. Logan","x":"We have had tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/watsco-wso-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2026 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Barry S. Logan","x":"We have had different tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/watsco-wso-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSO 2026 Q1","e":"wso","d":"2026-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"manag